(7597516, 1226364, 156466, '<td valign="top">I almost didn''t vote on this one for several reasons, none of them political. Mainly because while I appreciate your "animal" interpretation I was looking at this from the standpoint in which it was laid out and that caused me to knock points from anything that was constructed (I''ve seen others have said the same) and not an actual animal (which we could certainly debate). Still a brilliant assemblage.</td>', 'I almost didn''t vote on this one for several reasons, none of them political. Mainly because while I appreciate your "animal" interpretation I was looking at this from the standpoint in which it was laid out and that caused me to knock points from anything that was constructed (I''ve seen others have said the same) and not an actual animal (which we could certainly debate). Still a brilliant assemblage.', '2018-09-24 09:40:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(7597524, 1226366, 138630, '<td valign="top">This one had me and a friend guessing all week.  First we discussed - "Any idea WHATSOEVER what those white things are??"  Then I did Google searches, both general and image . . . warning - do not put the word "hairy" in a search, especially in combination with the word "vegetable", unless you want to see some images you won''t be able to unsee (as they say).  Then I did a screen shot on just the big one and put that in the image search.  Best match?  Sheep, hands down!  I even searched mushrooms because I suspected that was what it was - but turned up nothing. <br/> <br/>These are fascinating.  And, really, humble and endearing as Mariuca said.</td>', 'This one had me and a friend guessing all week.  First we discussed - "Any idea WHATSOEVER what those white things are??"  Then I did Google searches, both general and image . . . warning - do not put the word "hairy" in a search, especially in combination with the word "vegetable", unless you want to see some images you won''t be able to unsee (as they say).  Then I did a screen shot on just the big one and put that in the image search.  Best match?  Sheep, hands down!  I even searched mushrooms because I suspected that was what it was - but turned up nothing.  These are fascinating.  And, really, humble and endearing as Mariuca said.', '2018-09-24 11:11:27.000000', NULL, 0),
